<title>UK: Roche earnings estimates cut at CSFB.</title>
<headline>Roche earnings estimates cut at CSFB.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Earnings estimates for Roche Holding AG were cut at CS First Boston, in the wake of disappointing sales and operating margins figures from the Swiss drug group this week, the investment bank said on Friday.</p>
<p>For 1997, CSFB said it provisionally cut to around 500 francs from 544 and for 1998 it pencilled in 545-555 francs, compared with 620 proviously.</p>
<p>However CSFB repeated a &quot;buy&quot; recommendation on the stock, based on prospects for new drugs such as Xenical and Posicor.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
